WEBVTT

00:00:16.114 --> 00:00:18.300
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I’m near the hotel, I think…

00:00:18.793 --> 00:00:20.720
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hey! Look out!

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.900
This is a great camera!

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.660
Can I take a photo?

00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:27.198
Are you on holiday?

00:00:27.435 --> 00:00:29.632
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No. I’m a student.

00:00:29.635 --> 00:00:31.940
At the Tensquare School of Photography.

00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:35.220
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> These are good too.

00:00:36.443 --> 00:00:38.900
But these… are nothing special.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:40.894
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> How are you, Carla?

00:00:41.505 --> 00:00:42.880
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> I’m good. And you?

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:44.740
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Uh… are you two friends?

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.820
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do you want to go out sometime?

00:00:48.169 --> 00:00:48.603
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Me?

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:49.900
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Call me.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.180
What do you want to see?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.420
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I want to see the real London.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.340
Listen, Izzy.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:03.580
My photography class has a little show next week.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.060
Do you want to come?

00:01:07.136 --> 00:01:10.440
<v><b>Andre:</b></v> She’s very talented – in fact,

00:01:12.278 --> 00:01:14.100
she was my best student.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:18.540
And now she’s working as a bike courier.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:24.340
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Wow, these are… really professional.

00:01:25.743 --> 00:01:27.260
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I want to be a photo editor.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:35.220
I… sent in an application and I got an interview.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.211
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Oh, hey, Izzy! Good luck!

00:01:45.457 --> 00:01:46.606
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks, Pamela.

00:01:47.489 --> 00:01:49.300
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, uh…How did the interview go?

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:51.860
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I was amazing!

00:01:53.556 --> 00:01:54.516
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Of course you were.

00:01:55.094 --> 00:01:56.580
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> See you when you get back.